But alright, I guess I'd be fine with something like what you suggested. It can be written like this instead though, so we don't have to mess with parameter values:

```cpp
void PhysicsCollideShapeResult3D::set_max_collisions(int p_max_collisions) {
	ERR_FAIL_COND(p_max_collisions < 0);
	result.resize(2 * p_max_collisions);
	collision_count = MIN(collision_count, MIN(p_max_collisions, result.size() / 2));
}
```

